# Generated scan output. Scoped to the repository root on purpose: the bare
# pattern "report.*" also matched sarbar/report.py and sarbar/policies/report.yaml,
# which silently kept them out of the repository — anyone installing from GitHub
# would have got a package that cannot produce a report.
/report.html
/report.json
/report.sarif
/report.txt
/report.xml